# Current tool only. Historical specs and private audit files remain local.
*
!*/
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/.github/workflows/windows.yml
!/tools/public-source.json
!/tools/prepare-source.py
!/docs/windows-release.md
!/docs/generic-pdf-mode.md
